<th>Model</th>
<th>Tokens</th>
<th>Node-days</th>
<th>Restarts we could afford</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>1.3B</td>
<td>60B</td>
<td>2.5</td>
<td>12</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>7B</td>
<td>300B</td>
<td>21</td>
<td>3</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>30B</td>
<td>1T</td>
<td>190</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>The last column is the one that matters. A run you cannot restart is a run you cannot learn from.<sup><a href="#user-content-fn-1" id="user-content-user-content-fnref-1" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby="user-content-footnote-label">1</a></sup></p>
<h2 id="the-loss-we-actually-watch">The loss we actually watch</h2>
